# PLAN-852 ace-m1 negative cases rejected by BOTH legacy paths with
# typed codes (error completions need no oracle sidecar). T07 invalid
# unicode scalar: lexer E0001 on both. K04 borrow-escaping closure: the
# legacy grammar rejects the source at parse (auto_syntax_E0001); the
# designed type-level rule differs — channel frozen as observed.

```test-case
